    <statement><p>Evaluate <m>\int\!\!\int\!\!\int _{\mathcal{B}} f(x,y,z) \,dV</m> for the specified function <m>f</m> and <m>\mathcal{B}</m>:</p>
<p><me>f(x,y,z)=\frac{z}x\quad 3\le x\le 15,0\le y\le 4, 0\le z \le 6</me>
<m>\int\!\!\int\!\!\int _{\mathcal{B}} f( x,y,z ) \,dV =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>115.88</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>\begin{array}{rcl}
\int\!\!\int\!\!\int _{\mathcal{B}} f( x,y,z ) \,dV \amp =\amp 
\int_{3}^{15} \int_0^{4} \int_0^{6} \frac{z}{x} \,dz \,dy \,dx\\
\amp =\amp 
\left(\int_0^{6} z \,dz\right)\left(\int_0^{4} 1 \,dy\right)\left(\int_{3}^{15} \frac{1}{x} \,dx\right)\\
\amp =\amp 
\left(\frac{1}{2}{z}^2\bigg|_0^{6}\right)\left(y\bigg|_0^{4}\right)\left( \ln x\bigg|_{3}^{15}\right)\\
\amp =\amp 
18\cdot 4\cdot ( \ln {15}- \ln {3} )\\
\amp =\amp 72 \ln 5
\end{array}</me>






</solution>
